#: server/templates/home.html:38
msgid "원문을 바탕으로 검토하고, 판단의 근거를 함께 보여드려요."
msgstr ""
"We review from the original text and show the evidence for each judgment."

#: server/templates/issue_cards.html:9 server/templates/review_steps.html:58
